---
layout: null
permalink: /search-index.json
---
{% comment %}
  Build-time full-text search index for the reviews archive: one entry per
  review holding its plain-text body, so the archive can match words that
  appear deep inside a review rather than only in its card.

  Titles and summaries are deliberately not duplicated here — every card in the
  archive already carries them in the DOM, and the archive searches that text
  first. pages/reviews.html only downloads this file when a query has almost no
  matches in the card text, because it is the largest asset the site serves
  (~700 KB gzipped).
{% endcomment %}
[
{%- assign review_pages = site.pages | where: "layout", "review" | sort: "game_title" -%}
{%- for review in review_pages %}
  {
    "url": {{ review.url | jsonify }},
    "body": {{ review.content | markdownify | strip_html | normalize_whitespace | jsonify }}
  }{%- unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
{%- endfor %}
]
